        <div class="lio-faq-inline-list">
          <details class="lio-faq-item" open>
            <summary>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-q">Is this a vape?</span>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-caret" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="lio-faq-item-a"><p>No. A wooden aromatherapy diffuser. No battery, no coil, no liquid, no heating element. You breathe ordinary air through a wooden mouthpiece — the plant-oil core at the end gives it flavor and a cool menthol sensation. Nothing is heated, nothing is combusted.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="lio-faq-item">
            <summary>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-q">Will it feel like what I'm used to?</span>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-caret" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="lio-faq-item-a"><p>Partly. The menthol cores give a real <strong>cool throat hit</strong> on the inhale — the physical sensation is there. What's not there is the nicotine kick. Think of it as the feeling without the substance.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="lio-faq-item">
            <summary>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-q">How long does one core last?</span>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-caret" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="lio-faq-item-a"><p>Around <strong>7–10 days for a light user, 3–5 days if you use it heavily.</strong> The flavor is strongest the first day and gradually fades — when you can barely smell it before inhaling, swap it. The wooden body stays with you; only the core changes.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="lio-faq-item">
            <summary>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-q">What's actually in the cores?</span>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-caret" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="lio-faq-item-a"><p>Medical-grade polyester fiber infused with <strong>food-safe plant essential oils</strong> — peppermint, cinnamon, mango, orange, depending on the variant. No synthetic aromas, no solvents, no propylene glycol. Third-party tested, every batch.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="lio-faq-item">
            <summary>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-q">What if it doesn't work for me?</span>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-caret" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="lio-faq-item-a"><p>Try it for <strong>90 days</strong>. Use it the way it's meant to be used — every time you'd reach for your old habit. If the ritual doesn't land, <strong>full refund, used or not.</strong> No 'must be sealed' fine print, no restocking fee.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details class="lio-faq-item">
            <summary>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-q">How fast does it arrive?</span>
              <span class="lio-faq-item-caret" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="lio-faq-item-a"><p>Shipped from the Netherlands. <strong>2–3 working days across Europe, 4–8 days outside.</strong> Free worldwide, no minimum. Tracking link by email the moment it leaves the warehouse.</p></div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

